    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Headings\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. Ask AI Tutor: \"How do headings work in HTML?\"\r\n    - You can type directly, or highlight lines of code and select **\"Add to AI Tutor\"**.\r\n2. Ask AI Tutor to add new content using headings to this page.\r\n    - Be specific - use the tag name in your prompt (e.g., *\"Add an `<h2>` heading so that...\"*).\r\n\r\nOnce you've added your content, click **Continue**.",
